Subject: [PATCH] Add ayn-odin device tree

Signed-off-by: Demetris Ierokipides <ierokipides.dem@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile            |    1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-ayn-odin.dts | 1933 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 1934 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-ayn-odin.dts

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
index 296688f7c..18c6ff6c2 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
@@ -257,6 +257,7 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sdm845-sony-xperia-tama-apollo.dtb
